	(text "Nothing resistive hangs on the node after the shunts: its current would be measured.\nC53 is the only capacitor there (C0G, 100 nF). No gate-to-source resistor on Q9 and Q10.\nVOUT_BUF: guard ring around the sense nodes, supply of the level translator, monitor input.\nD9 clamps VOUT to ground and to about 6.2 V (5.6 V node plus one diode).\nJ3 (pin header) and J4 (lever terminal block) carry the same nets in the order of\nthe PPK2: GND, VIN, VOUT, GND. VIN is the external supply of ampere mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 137.16 0)
